@startuml F-物流货运
' 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 L3 · F 物流货运（UC-SUB-F-01 ~ F-05）
title 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 · F 物流货运
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "货主" as SHIPPER
actor "货运司机" as DRIVER
actor "监管人员" as REGU

rectangle "F 物流货运" {
  usecase "UC-SUB-F-01 发布货源并自由接单" as F01
  usecase "UC-SUB-F-02 查看在途位置并存证轨迹" as F02
  usecase "UC-SUB-F-03 核验司机资质并建信用档案" as F03
  usecase "UC-SUB-F-04 托管并结算运费" as F04
  usecase "UC-SUB-F-05 公示货运费率与抽成" as F05
}

SHIPPER --> F01
SHIPPER --> F02
SHIPPER --> F04
SHIPPER --> F05
DRIVER --> F01
DRIVER --> F02
DRIVER --> F03
DRIVER --> F04
DRIVER --> F05
REGU --> F02

note bottom of F02
  手机 GPS；监管端异常停留/偏航预警
end note
note bottom of F04
  与 I-03 共用结算体系（跨模块）
end note
@enduml
